     2	
     3	Status: agreed design target (2026-09-13). This document is the macro
     4	contract for `yin.vm`. It supersedes the v1 stream model in
     5	[`macro-design.md`](./macro-design.md), the strategy in
     6	[`../cross-language-macro.md`](../cross-language-macro.md), and the previous
     7	revision of this document, which integrated expansion into the evaluators;
     8	Appendix A records what that revision proposed and why it is withdrawn. It
     9	is subordinate to [`datom.world.md`](./datom.world.md) and
    10	[`dao.stream.md`](./dao.stream.md). Revision 3 folds in the round-2 reviews
    11	(`collab/1789277584941-review-macro-stream-process-r2.{gpt-6-astra,glm-5.3}.findings.md`);
    12	Appendix C maps each finding to its resolution.
    13	
    14	The design follows from one framing and adds nothing to it:
    15	
    16	> Every `yin.vm` evaluator is an observer of a `dao.stream` medium. The
    17	> writer to that medium is just another process. Macro expansion is such a
    18	> process.
